0 | 362,500 |\n| **All offices** | 739,280 | 756,280 | 830,260 | 2,325,820 |\n\n**Summary**\n- Average revenue per office and month: 129,212\n- Growth from October to December, all offices: 12.3%\n\nThe Q4 totals, the All offices row and both summary figures are formulas, not typed numbers.\n\n**Where the figures came from**\n- **Lisbon:** I used the final November figure (69,850). The earlier draft (74,600) counted a 4,750 invoice that belongs to December.\n- **Vienna:** its report gives revenue in thousands of euros (112.4, 118.9, 131.2), so I entered 112,400, 118,900 and 131,200.\n- **Stockholm:** its revenue table is split over two pages. I used the revenue column, not the budget column, from page 2.\n- **Dublin:** the figures are from the news article on the intranet.\n- **Hamburg and Rotterdam:** the figures are from the Region North report.\n\nAll five of your Chromium tabs are still open on their reports. In the Stockholm tab I clicked to page 2 of the table, and in the Lisbon tab I expanded the older updates. Neither change touched the sheet.", "machine": "5600X", "desktop": "omarchy", "identity": {"driver": "g03klk4s9siab83pq0r082hxzwjlpqxg-nixos-test-driver-hyprmasq-bench-calc-chromium-omarchy", "server": "l3ywv7yrnal4rlpl5g7nf8abyi35k6b2-hyprmasq-bench-mcp"}, "versions": {"hyprland": "0.56.2"}, "cpu": "AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor"},
